{"reviews":[{"id":"B0090858OG-0","r":5.0,"t":"and I like that is unscented","x":"I use Alberto  Vo5 unscented hair spray for years, and when I could not find it in a store anymore, I tried others.  This holds, doesn't make hair sticky, and I like that is unscented, as I am sensitive to aromas.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B0090858OG-1","r":5.0,"t":"Crystal Clear decision","x":"I am someone who cannot use anything with fragrance. Essentially being a bubble boy because of my multitude of skin allergies, my options for haircare are extremely limited. I was unaware that almost every cosmetic product in the world contains formaldehyde (yes think about that weird frog floating around dead in biology) as well as fragrance so they were all causing me great discomfort. This is one of the few products I can use. It holds very well, has minimal smell and keeps my perfect coiffur","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B0090858OG-2","r":5.0,"t":"This hairspray works great. I cannot find it in the stores","x":"This hairspray works great.I cannot find it in the stores. I was looking for an unscented hairspray that actually has no perfumey scent and that would really hold my hair. This hairspray has a firm hold, not sticky, dries fast. It does leave a bit of build up.  I can comb and rearrange if I want to.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B0090858OG-3","r":1.0,"t":"Not unscented.","x":"Not unscented to me, I have pretty bad fragrance sensitivity and was hopeful based on the reviews here, but sadly cannot continue using it. (Also unfortunate that it cannot be returned even though it is not as advertised).","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B0090858OG-4","r":5.0,"t":"Fragrance Free","x":"I have a contact allergy to fragrance and this is one of the few hair sprays I can use. It works well and the can size lasts a long time.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B0090858OG-5","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent hair spray","x":"Excellent hair spray for my baby fine hair.  Not too sticky and dries quickly.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B0090858OG-6","r":5.0,"t":"Great Hairspray for Sensitive Scalps","x":"I think I've tried every hairspray on the market and reacted with itchy scalp to all of them and quit using hairspray. Then, at my beauty shop, one lady brought in this VO5 unscented hairspray as she has the same problem. She let me try it and my head didn't itch.  So happy to find this and now, maybe my hair will stay in place for more than 5 minutes.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B0090858OG-7","r":1.0,"t":"Not the same as pictured item","x":"When arrived, not the same type of spray nozzle as in picture. It was typical spray unit where you have remove cap. Not the same quality!!!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B0090858OG-8","r":5.0,"t":"Light but holds well..","x":"This hairspray is very light and holds well. I also like the unscented. The scented is way too strong!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B0090858OG-9","r":1.0,"t":"NOT THE SAME\u2026Disappointed!","x":"Like other reviewers, this product is not the same. I have been using this hairspray for years and I am disappointed with my last order. The style of the top where it sprays has changed. Now it has a cap that needs to be removed to reveal the nozzle. When you first press it down air comes out and then finally the product. The air messes up your hair so the spray then sprays the messed up hair. I felt like I needed to use more of this spray to get a decent hold. Many times it felt like there was ","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B0090858OG-10","r":5.0,"t":"A very natural hold","x":"I have used this product since the 1950's.  My local grocery store stopped carrying it so I bought it at Amazon and was so glad to find it there.  When my daughter came for a visit she used my hairspray and raved about it so I bought her some and shipped it to her.  Her comment was the same as mine.  The spray is not wet and the hair feels natural and holds well.  I am 85 and my daughter is 58 and being women, we never stop caring about how our hair looks.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B0090858OG-11","r":2.0,"t":"THIS IS NOT UNSCENTED.","x":"I am allergic to fragrance.  Companies should not put \"unscented\" on their products that are clearly scented.  There is a reason people look for UNSCENTED.  If that is what you are truly looking for, this is NOT IT>  THIS PRODUCT HAS FRAGRANCE. This was even on my list of okay to use per the dermatologist.  Instant raging headache, ringing ears, and dizziness.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B0090858OG-12","r":5.0,"t":"Call this \"industrial strength\" Hair Spray","x":"I have used this hair spray for 30 years!  About the only place I can find it, now, is on Amazon.  So, I buy it 6 cans at a time.  I have very fine blond hair; it's about the only spray that will hold it in place.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B0090858OG-13","r":5.0,"t":"Wrong old cans of hair spray with CAPS-does not work as well.  My last ord TBA192134528804.","x":"Very upset- with my last 3 cans of hairspray-which I order every month.  You sent me cans of hairspray that was old cans with caps on them.  They do not work as well, and I am very upset.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B0090858OG-14","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"Possibly the worst hairspray in the world...I wish there was a way to get my money back!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B0090858OG-15","r":5.0,"t":"Great spray","x":"Live this spray- unscented so it doesn\u2019t bother allergies. Wish it weren\u2019t so pricey.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B0090858OG-16","r":4.0,"t":"I'm glad I did because this is an excellent hairspray for ...","x":"I would never have tried this hairspray had I not been diagnosed with allergies.  Having said that, I'm glad I did because this is an excellent hairspray for fine hair.  It has enough hold, doesn't weigh my hair down and I'm as pleased with it as I was with my old, more expensive, fragrance-laden brand. I only give it 4 stars because of the cons; the spray button could be better designed and  after extensive searching, I was only able to find it at a CVS Pharmacy in McHenry, IL.  Wish it was rea","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B0090858OG-17","r":1.0,"t":"Not unscented. No returns.","x":"Not unscented. Very strong scent that lingers and gives me a migraine. One cap arrived broken and there was no returns!  I wish that would be indicated before making a purchase. Waste of my money.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B0090858OG-18","r":5.0,"t":"Still satisfied","x":"Have purchased this item before, always with the best results. This time there was a delay in delivery but it was rectified to my satisfaction.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B0090858OG-19","r":2.0,"t":"Skip this one","x":"This product does not hold your hairdo no matter how much you put on your hair.  Sadly, it dries out the scalp and causes horrific itching.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B0090858OG-20","r":5.0,"t":"Hold with a natural feel","x":"Can\u2019t find this in any stores and don\u2019t know why - it\u2019s the best for hold with a natural feel.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B0090858OG-21","r":5.0,"t":"It also works great!!","x":"I was looking for a less toxic hair spray and this fit the bill.  It also works great!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B0090858OG-22","r":5.0,"t":"Great product","x":"Better product than the one I used to buy at the store. They do not sell it anymore.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B0090858OG-23","r":1.0,"t":"Price Gouge","x":"Nice product but the price is outrageous. $2.50 ea at Kmart when on sale.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B0090858OG-24","r":4.0,"t":"Good unscented hairspray","x":"I have fragrance allergies but this hairspray doesn\u2019t make me break out.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers praise the hairspray for being unscented and suitable for fragrance sensitivity or allergies.","cites":[1,2,5,7,9]},{"text":"Several reviewers report the product is not actually unscented and caused reactions despite fragrance sensitivity.","cites":[4,12]},{"text":"Reviewers commonly say it provides a firm, light hold that is not sticky and dries quickly.","cites":[1,3,6,9,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers complain that recent orders arrived with a different cap/nozzle design than pictured and perform worse.","cites":[8,10,14]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention buildup or dissatisfaction with overall quality.","cites":[3,15]}]},"qa":[]}